# Copy to `.env.local`, then fill in a key issued for the *web* source. The
# relay is server-to-server, so the ingester sees no Origin header and the
# allow-list never comes into play — but the events still belong to the web
# surface, so keep the source honest.
#
#   node apps/polaris-cli/dist/bin/polaris.js keys create \
#     --project storefront --env development --source storefront-web --type web
#
# No NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix anywhere: that is the entire point of this sample.
POLARIS_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4000/v1/events
POLARIS_API_KEY=
